RocketHideout_B3F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "Stop meddling in TEAM ONYBRIS's\n"
    .string "affairs or else!$"

RocketHideout_B3F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "Oof!\n"
    .string "Taken down!$"

RocketHideout_B3F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "The LIFT KEY? One of the guards\n"
    .string "below keeps it on him.\p"
    .string "Read the ledger in the office if\n"
    .string "you want to know what you are up\l"
    .string "against.$"

RocketHideout_B3F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "We got word from upstairs that you\n"
    .string "were coming!$"

RocketHideout_B3F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "What?\n"
    .string "I lost? No!$"

RocketHideout_B3F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
    .string "Go ahead and go!\p"
    .string "But you can't run the elevator\n"
    .string "without the LIFT KEY.$"

RocketHideout_B3F_Text_Ledger::
    .string "A ledger lies open on the new desk.\p"
    .string "“BRANCH 3 of 7: the money branch.\n"
    .string "Casino takings: sorted, counted,\l"
    .string "sent up to V.”\p"
    .string "“Old ROCKET base: 4 rooms cleaned,\n"
    .string "the rest is junk. Do not bother.”\p"
    .string "“Quartz is in V.'s pocket. The\n"
    .string "boss wants ten stones, not one.”\p"
    .string "You keep one page: a cash voucher.$"

RocketHideout_B3F_Text_LedgerDone::
    .string "Only dull numbers and a stamp:\n"
    .string "“BRANCH 3 of 7”.$"

